  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n[Am]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Dadd11]\n[D]  [C#dim]  [Bm]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[G7M/B]\n[D]  [C#dim]  [Bm]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[G7M/B]\n[D]  [C#dim]  [Bm]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[G7M/B]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]Did, did, did, did you see the\n[B/A]frightened ones?\n[Am]Did, did, did, did you hear the\n[B/A]falling bombs?\n[Am]Did, did, did, did you ever\n[B/A]wonder why we [Am]had to run for\n[G/A][A7]shelter when the [D/A]Promise of a brave\n[Em/A]new world unfurled [D/A]beneath [C/A]a\n[G7M/B]clear blue sky?\n\n[Interlude]\n[Dadd11]\n[D]  [C#dim]  [Bm]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[G7M/B]\n[D]  [C#dim]  [Bm]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[G7M/B]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]Did, did, did, did you see the\n[B/A]frightened ones?\n[Am]Did, did, did, did you hear the\n[B/A]falling bombs?\n[Am]The flames are all long gone,\n[B/A]but the pain [C#][C]lingers [D]on\n\n[Chorus]\n[Aadd11][D]Goodbye,\n[A7]blue [D]sky\n[Aadd11]Goodbye,\n[A7]blue [D]sky [Cadd9]Goodbye\n[Cadd9][D]Goodbye\n\n[Outro]\n[D]",
